  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A new option when you create a new (public?) instance of a world:\n-If user is 18+ (account dob), user can check a box to mark the world instance as 18+.\n-Similarly, users under 18 can mark the instance as under 18.\n-Default can remain all ages as it is now.\nWhen a user is looking at a world they might want to join, the user can tick a box to only show instances that fit their age category (either 18+ or under 18).\nWhy this feature? It would be *extremely* simple to implement. Has nothing to do with NSFW content. It would be effective and useful for a large majority of users.",
